WEBVTT

00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:07.440
(LAUGHING)

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:09.640
Money, money, money. Hey!

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:15.040
(GROANING)

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:19.200
You got a date with justice,
One-Eyed Bart.

00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:22.200
Too bad, Sheriff. I'm a married man.

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:23.320
(MRS. POTATO HEAD EXCLAIMING)

00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:25.400
One-Eyed Betty!

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:34.520
Whoa! Whoa!

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:38.160
-(YELLING)
-(MR. POTATO HEAD CACKLING)

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:39.360
(GASPS)

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.040
I think you dropped something, mister.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.840
-Jessie?
-Give it up, Bart!

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:46.440
You've reached the end of the line!

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:48.680
I always wanted to go out with a bang!

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:00.080
-Oh, no!
-The orphans!

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:04.360
Hate to leave early, but our ride is here.

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:05.920
(CAR HONKING)

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:09.440
Ooh!

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:12.800
It's me or the kiddies, Sheriff.
Take your pick.

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:14.040
Whoo-hoo!

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:18.880
-Ride like the wind, Bullseye!
-Hee-yah!

00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:25.560
Hold him steady!

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:32.280
Woody, hurry!

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:44.080
(GASPING)

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:54.760
No!

00:02:58.240 --> 00:02:59.280
(MUFFLED THUD)

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:05.480
Glad I could catch the train!

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:07.800
Now let's catch some criminals.

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:10.440
To infinity and beyond!

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:16.280
-(LAUGHS)
-Whoo-hoo!

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:17.440
ALIENS: Ooh!

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:29.080
Reach for the sky.

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:30.480
You can't touch me, Sheriff!

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:33.720
I brought my attack dog
with a built-in force field.

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:34.840
(WHISTLES)

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:37.960
(GROWLS)

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:39.480
(LAUGHING)

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:45.520
Well, I brought my dinosaur
who eats force-field dogs.

00:03:45.640 --> 00:03:49.880
Yodel-ay-hee-hoo!

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:57.080
(ROARING)

00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:58.240
Huh?

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:06.640
Evil Dr. Pork Chop!

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:11.720
That's Mr. Evil Dr. Pork Chop to you.

00:04:11.840 --> 00:04:13.080
(LAUGHS)

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:29.560
(ROARS)

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:30.840
(WHIMPERS)

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:33.040
(MONKEYS SCREAMING)

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:35.200
(YELLS)

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:37.280
(GRUNTS)

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:47.400
(CACKLING)

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:53.920
(ANDY CACKLING)

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:56.160
ANDY: "Buzz,
shoot your laser at my badge."

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:58.080
"Woody, no. It'll kill you." "Just do it!"

00:04:58.600 --> 00:04:59.760
(MIMICS LASERFIRE)

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:01.200
(MIMICS EXPLOSION)

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:05.720
"You're going to jail, Bart."
(YELLS) "Watch out!"

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:07.840
(ANDY'S MOM LAUGHING)

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:08.960
Mom!

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:12.000
ANDY'S MOM: No, no, no. Just keep
playing. Just pretend I'm not here.

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:13.200
Oh, no, Molly!

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:17.000
No, it's okay, Mom.
It's a 50-foot baby from outer space.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:19.760
And she's on a rampage.
Run for your lives!

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:23.040
Buster, get out of there.
Does the red light mean it's going?

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:24.400
(SOULFUL MUSIC PLAYING)

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:26.440
Come on.
Say "Happy birthday" to Molly.

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:30.320
-Happy birthday!
-ANDY'S MOM: Oh, charming.

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:32.080
Happy birthday!

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:34.560
ANDY'S MOM:
Look how tall you're getting.

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:36.000
Yeah! Whoo-hoo!

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:42.080
(LAUGHS)

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:46.240
"I came as fast as I could.
Buzz, behind you!"

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:47.920
"Got it, Woody."

00:05:48.600 --> 00:05:50.760
VOICE BOX:
Buzz Lightyear to the rescue!

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:54.000
"Good work, Buzz."

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.960
Yee-haw!

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:04.200
(MIMICKING AIRPLANE)

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:08.160
(LAUGHING)

